    "summary": "Use it in the opponent's [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) as an enemy unit is picked for a **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** while **engaged** with 1 of your **BEAST SNAGGA** units. That **BEAST SNAGGA** unit is the target.\n\nThe enemy unit is forced into **[desperate escape](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape-2)** mode. If the escaping unit is **MONSTER/VEHICLE**, it also makes 3 extra **[hazard rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls)** per **BEAST SNAGGA** unit engaged with it, each at -1 if it is **battle-shocked**.",
